          },
          {
            "claim": "If m,n have opposite parity, then v_2(a)=v_2(b)=-3.",
            "support": "Here H, D, m^2-7n^2, and 7m^2-n^2 are odd. The latter two factors are nonzero: their vanishing would imply that a rational square equals 7 or 1/7. Thus the displayed valuations follow, and both are negative."
          },
          {
            "claim": "If m,n are both odd, then v_2(H)=1, v_2(D)≥3, and v_2(m^2-7n^2)=v_2(7m^2-n^2)=1; hence v_2(a)≤-5 and v_2(b)=-3v_2(D)<0.",
