          },
          {
            "claim": "The third coordinate is nonintegral throughout the stated domain.",
            "support": "H+D=2m^2>0 and H-D=2n^2>0 imply 0<|D|<H. Therefore 0<|c|=(8/9)|D/H|^3<8/9, which excludes every integer."
